---

## Base URL

```
https://api.lament.rynds.my.id
```

## Authentication

Most endpoints require the `X-Master-Key` header:

```bash
curl -H "X-Master-Key: your_key" https://api.lament.rynds.my.id/tracks
```

Public endpoints (streaming, health checks) do not require authentication.

## Response Format

All endpoints return JSON. Successful responses follow this pattern:

```json
{
  "data": [...],
  "total": 100
}
```

Error responses:

```json
{
  "error": "E_AUTH"
}
```

## Status Codes

| Code | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `200` | Success |
| `201` | Created |
| `401` | Unauthorized — missing or invalid API key |
| `404` | Not found |
| `500` | Internal server error |
| `503` | Service unavailable — maintenance mode |

## Pagination

List endpoints support pagination via query parameters:

| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `offset` | integer | `0` | Number of items to skip |
| `limit` | integer | `20` | Number of items to return |

## Rate Limiting

No explicit rate limiting is currently enforced. Cache-control headers are applied to public endpoints.

## Available Endpoints

| Resource | Endpoints |
| --- | --- |
| [Tracks](/api/tracks) | `GET /tracks`, `GET /tracks/:id`, `POST /tracks`, `PUT /tracks/:id`, `DELETE /tracks/:id` |
| [Artists](/api/artists) | `GET /artists`, `GET /artists/:id`, `POST /artists`, `PUT /artists/:id`, `DELETE /artists/:id` |
| [Albums](/api/albums) | `GET /albums`, `GET /albums/:id`, `POST /albums`, `PUT /albums/:id`, `DELETE /albums/:id` |
| [Search](/api/search) | `GET /search` |
| [Lyrics](/api/lyrics) | `GET /tracks/:id/lyrics`, `POST /tracks/:id/lyrics`, `DELETE /lyrics/:id` |
| [Streaming](/api/streaming) | `GET /stream/:id/playlist.m3u8`, `GET /stream/:id/:segment` |
| [Requests](/api/requests) | `GET /requests`, `POST /requests` |
| [Playlists](/api/playlists) | `GET /playlists/:id`, `POST /playlists`, `PUT /playlists/:id`, `DELETE /playlists/:id` |
| [Categories](/api/categories) | `GET /categories` |
